8757920768215473.jpeg/iiZR5Ssv_q45DL5-Nc3bON7361QvjcBuh0_Ee4dPxHs\"/><figcaption>泰姆布為了想創下「哭最久」的紀錄，嘗試挑戰「連續哭100小時不停」，沒想到卻因此差點失明，過程也不被健力士世界紀錄認可。（IG@237_towncryer）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「華人生活網」授權轉載，微信公眾號：Huarenlife168】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:22.908613+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3696,"images":32,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:45.576884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:35.166286+00:00","content_hash":"f61ce964784cbca83d6a21c91d1b7cec8a1d63750d9c54821c2ff7d1b15d1a59","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}